  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 RNA encoder with imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_039) achieves the highest accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests replacing imagenet_vit_l with resnet50 in a multimodal setup with the same RNA encoder, aggregation, and fusion strategy. It isolates the impact of image encoder choice, a critical design decision, to determine if resnet50 underperforms compared to the stronger imagenet_vit_l encoder. This comparison provides direct evidence on the importance of image encoder quality in multimodal settings, balancing exploration of key components with exploitation of promising directions."
}

